{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48264","headline":"咏崔云娘 · 李宣古","name":"咏崔云娘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何事最堪悲，云娘只首奇。\n瘦拳抛令急，长啸出歌迟。\n只见肩侵鬓，唯忧骨透皮。\n不须当户立，头上有锺馗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李宣古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}